    "drift": "Cross-language contract of design §6.5 / §7. api-service SHOULD adopt the SAME file so the GitHub-ruleset glob dialect cannot drift between Python and Go. NOTE this glob is DIFFERENT from engine_cases.json's `glob` op (there '*' crosses '/'; here it does not).",
    "schema": {
